    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d540">

                <pb facs="0625" n="551" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav01/pg551"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 701.6111/221</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Russia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Francis</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Petrograd</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-06-05T17:00:00+04:31">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 5, 1918, 5 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received June 7, 3.16 a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1. Following just received via Vologda, addressed American Ambassador: <quote
                        rend="blockquote">
                        <p>Russian government nominates as plenipotentiary representative in
                            Washington Citizen Litvinov now same in Paris
                            [London]. Hopes friendship your Government will not object our purpose
                            closer relations, intimate friendship between our peoples. Commissary
                            Foreign Affairs, Chicherin.</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <p>See my telegram of June 5, 6 p.m.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Francis</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
